1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:01,800
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,480
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:05,120
♪When you say you love me♪

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,680
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,640
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,400
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,760
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,480
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,200
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,840
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:20,560
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,520
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:27,360
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,720
=The One=

16
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:31,280
=Episode 16=

17
00:00:32,064 --> 00:00:37,544
(Unknown Number)

18
00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:38,679
(Cheng Lin.)

19
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:40,600
(We need to talk.)

20
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:42,719
It's you.

21
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:45,200
The Ji Group charity gala

22
00:00:45,399 --> 00:00:46,640
will draw the city's elite,

23
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,560
including partners
from the top three law firms.

24
00:00:49,359 --> 00:00:52,000
It's our last shot at the Ji contract.

25
00:00:54,479 --> 00:00:55,079
Su Yan.

26
00:00:55,439 --> 00:00:56,000
I know

27
00:00:56,359 --> 00:00:57,560
you're going through a really dark time.

28
00:00:58,399 --> 00:00:59,159
But remember,

29
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:01,000
don't let your personal life

30
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:01,759
cloud

31
00:01:02,159 --> 00:01:02,960
your professional judgment.

32
00:01:04,053 --> 00:01:04,837
(You're Invited)

33
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:05,400
Understood?

34
00:01:13,322 --> 00:01:15,076
(You're Invited)

35
00:01:15,079 --> 00:01:15,760
Understood.

36
00:01:16,640 --> 00:01:17,599
Thank you.

37
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:20,799
Su Yan.

38
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:22,719
If you're not ready,

39
00:01:23,319 --> 00:01:24,120
don't go.

40
00:01:28,359 --> 00:01:29,200
I'm going.

41
00:01:30,959 --> 00:01:31,599
Then we should

42
00:01:32,239 --> 00:01:33,920
arrive as an engaged couple.

43
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:34,439
It'd look better.

44
00:01:34,959 --> 00:01:35,400
No.

45
00:01:36,599 --> 00:01:38,200
We'll go as a team.

46
00:01:38,599 --> 00:01:38,959
But...

47
00:01:38,959 --> 00:01:39,760
Duan Cizhou.

48
00:01:40,480 --> 00:01:42,319
For everything we've been through,

49
00:01:42,799 --> 00:01:43,760
please respect me.

50
00:01:58,799 --> 00:01:59,359
What do you want?

51
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:02,560
You got out of juvie

52
00:02:03,519 --> 00:02:04,560
without even going to high school.

53
00:02:05,319 --> 00:02:06,560
All you do is wait tables

54
00:02:07,079 --> 00:02:08,400
and fight for cash?

55
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:08,919
What,

56
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:10,960
does that bother you too, Mr. Ji?

57
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,159
You're broke.

58
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:18,360
Is Ms. Su really your sugar mama?

59
00:02:23,759 --> 00:02:24,520
What do you want?

60
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,560
She was your first?

61
00:02:28,319 --> 00:02:29,039
Your first love?

62
00:02:29,039 --> 00:02:30,240
None of your business.

63
00:02:30,719 --> 00:02:31,759
What do you really want?

64
00:02:32,319 --> 00:02:33,280
Don't get so worked up.

65
00:02:34,639 --> 00:02:35,400
Want to help her?

66
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:39,000
Let's make a deal.

67
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,319
Hey, do you think

68
00:02:45,319 --> 00:02:46,879
Su Yan will show up tonight?

69
00:02:47,639 --> 00:02:49,039
Her reputation's ruined.

70
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:50,960
She wouldn't dare show her face here.

71
00:03:05,199 --> 00:03:06,120
Su Yan's here.

72
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:08,800
She's got some nerve.

73
00:03:09,599 --> 00:03:11,719
(Even your fiancé
can't clear your name.)

74
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,680
(Su Yan.)

75
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:15,840
(I'll humiliate you
in front of everyone.)

76
00:03:18,439 --> 00:03:19,120
Mr. Ji.

77
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:20,000
Mr. Ji.

78
00:03:23,719 --> 00:03:24,159
Mr. Duan.

79
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:25,199
Ms. Su.

80
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:26,039
Welcome.

81
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:29,520
So you two are back together?

82
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:31,719
When will we hear the good news?

83
00:03:32,199 --> 00:03:34,919
Smart PR move, given all the rumors.

84
00:03:35,639 --> 00:03:37,000
Thanks for your concern, Mr. Ji.

85
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:37,919
But

86
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:39,280
we're not going to

87
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:40,479
put on an act

88
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:41,800
to counter false rumors.

89
00:03:42,319 --> 00:03:43,199
I heard you've invited

90
00:03:43,199 --> 00:03:45,840
several other top law firms.

91
00:03:46,319 --> 00:03:47,520
Mr. Duan and I are confident

92
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:49,840
we can still win the contract.

93
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:52,120
- Good luck.
- (Who's that?)

94
00:03:54,479 --> 00:03:55,560
(He looks so refined.)

95
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:00,159
(Who's that gentleman?)

96
00:04:00,159 --> 00:04:02,080
(Wouldn't mind some fun with him.)

97
00:04:03,199 --> 00:04:05,199
(Which family is he from?)

98
00:04:05,919 --> 00:04:07,800
(So young and polished.)

99
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:08,879
(He's gorgeous.)

100
00:04:09,199 --> 00:04:10,960
Gentleman?

101
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:13,560
He's the boy toy Su Yan keeps.

102
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:16,680
She's really lost it.

103
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:18,480
She actually brought her pet here.

104
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,720
This is going to be good.

105
00:04:25,439 --> 00:04:27,319
You shouldn't have brought him here.

106
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,040
Su Yan.

107
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:34,000
What are you doing here?

108
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:35,920
Didn't you bring him?

109
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:39,720
Oh.

110
00:04:40,160 --> 00:04:41,560
So you've got a new sugar mama.

111
00:04:41,959 --> 00:04:43,160
Who brought you here?

112
00:04:44,399 --> 00:04:45,560
I invited him.

113
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:47,800
Cheng Lin.

114
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:48,519
Come here.

115
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:56,279
The suit fits you well.

116
00:04:56,759 --> 00:04:57,720
You clean up nicely.

117
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,920
Come on. I'll introduce you around.

118
00:05:04,839 --> 00:05:05,199
He...

119
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:07,360
He's with Mr. Ji now?

120
00:05:09,399 --> 00:05:10,920
Mr. Ji's wife left him

121
00:05:11,079 --> 00:05:13,319
because he prefers men?

122
00:05:17,519 --> 00:05:18,759
I'll go get a drink.

123
00:05:29,350 --> 00:05:31,554
(Professor Ge)

124
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:53,560
(Su Yan. Su Yan. Calm down.)

125
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:57,199
- (Calm down. Calm down. Calm down.)
- Professor Ge, this way.

126
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:03,680
(It's time to end this nightmare)

127
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:05,360
(that's haunted me for years.)

128
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:10,560
What?

129
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:12,199
Feeling guilty now that you see my dad?

130
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:18,000
He's the one who should feel guilty.

131
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:21,160
I really underestimated you.

132
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:23,000
With all this scrutiny on you,

133
00:06:23,519 --> 00:06:26,279
you dare bring both your ex
and your new toy.

134
00:06:26,759 --> 00:06:28,600
Trying to show off your skills with men?

135
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:33,560
Ge Yao, whatever happened between
your parents and me,

136
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:35,120
I never held it against you.

137
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:37,279
But if you sink to their level,

138
00:06:37,879 --> 00:06:39,079
I'll sue you for defamation.

139
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:40,600
Go ahead.

140
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:42,240
I'd love to see,

141
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:44,079
with public opinion as it is,

142
00:06:44,279 --> 00:06:45,920
who people will side with,

143
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,720
you or me.

144
00:06:56,318 --> 00:06:57,518
Thank you all for joining us

145
00:06:57,519 --> 00:06:59,519
at the Ji Group Charity Gala.

146
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:02,079
(Ji Group Charity Gala)
My wife was supposed to join me,

147
00:07:02,839 --> 00:07:04,199
but she's upset with me

148
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:06,199
and left home.

149
00:07:07,079 --> 00:07:08,399
I've set up a livestream

150
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:09,959
(Ji Charity Gala)
in hopes she'll see it.

151
00:07:15,959 --> 00:07:16,759
(Uh... what?)

152
00:07:16,759 --> 00:07:19,680
(What... what is this?)

153
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:20,920
(How did this happen?)

154
00:07:23,279 --> 00:07:24,519
(What is this?)

155
00:07:26,536 --> 00:07:27,443
(Su Yan.)

156
00:07:28,621 --> 00:07:29,514
(Tell me.)

157
00:07:30,298 --> 00:07:31,810
(What would make you feel better?)

158
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:35,320
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

159
00:07:35,320 --> 00:07:38,840
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

160
00:07:38,840 --> 00:07:42,360
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

161
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:46,120
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

162
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:04,600
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

163
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:08,240
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

164
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:11,440
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

165
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:15,120
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

166
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:18,520
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

167
00:08:18,520 --> 00:08:22,200
♪I hum this song alone♪

168
00:08:22,200 --> 00:08:26,040
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

169
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:30,120
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

170
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:33,400
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

171
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:37,000
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

172
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:40,480
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

173
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:45,360
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
